  offerLine: It's too... dry. Out there. And bare. I'd need a bush... to sit under, and a place that feels... like someone lives there.
  activeLine: A bush, please. And cosy. I can wait. I'm very good at it.
  readyLine: Oh. Oh, this is the spot. You know what, I'll come foraging. Eventually. I know where the worms are. They don't... run from me.
  doneLine: We'll get there.
